        "chunk_company_x_policy_0",
        {
          "type": "chunk",
          "text": "{\n  \"company_name\": \"Company X\",\n  \"document_title\": \"Corporate Data Sharing Protocol\",\n  \"content\": \"Company X partners with Supplier B to process its core customer transaction records. As part of this corporate partnership, Company X shares protected Customer Data, which includes Personally Identifiable Information (PII) such as full names, social security numbers, and banking details. Under section 4 of the agreement, Supplier B is responsible for storing and managing this data in their database servers. Company X mandates that any external partner must implement encryption at rest, but cyb",
          "source_file": "company_x_policy.json",
          "doc_type": "json"
        }
      ],
      [
